(73,	'Hydraulic Hand Pallet Truck SPPT 2.0',	20,	'1576824522.jpg',	'hydraulic-hand-pallet-truck-sppt-2-0',	'Hydraulic pallet trucks that have high load bearing capacity and require minimum maintenance. These are equipped with Nylon roller wheels and fork size of 1130 x 520 LXW. Highly easy to operate, these trucks require minimum pulling power. The pallet truck also has bushed metal to metal parts that do not require any greasing and it also has a control lever with three-positions of up, neutral and down. ',	' - Low Maintenance - Maximum Manoeuvrability - Silent In Operation - No Oil Leakage - Robust quality with considerate design',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
