(76,	'Hydraulic Reel Pallet Truck SPRT 3.0',	20,	'1576496577.jpg',	'hydraulic-reel-pallet-truck-sprt-3-0',	'Hydraulic Reel Pallet Truck facilitates in the smooth and easy movement of warp beam or rolls. The beam flanges are rested on the trolley while transporting. Equipped with premium quality seals and wipers that are the best in India, these pallet trucks are appropriate for carrying beams with width up to 3800 mm, beam flange diameter from 800 mm to 1250 mm. ',	' - Dimensionally accurate. - Low Maintenance - Corrosion resistant. - Light in weight. - Longer service life.',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(77,	'Hydraulic High Lift Pallet Truck SPPT 105HL',	20,	'1576496634.jpg',	'hydraulic-high-lift-pallet-truck-sppt-105hl',	'The high lift pallet truck is offered in standard capacity of 800 kg and fork length of 1100mm ',	' - High lift pallet trucks can reach a maximum height of 800mm - Forks are raised by a hand operated hydraulic pump in High lift pallet trucks - The piston is polished and hard chromed and the unit has high pressure polyurethane seals 800 / 1000 kg capacit',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(78,	'Drum Pallet Truck SPDT 0.3',	20,	'1576496682.jpg',	'drum-pallet-truck-spdt-0-3',	'The Drum Pallet Truck is one of the latest style pallet trucks. It has a good capacity to carry almost 660 lbs at one go. Average 55 gallons of steel drums can be lifted using the Drum Pallet Truck. This is a huge number of drums, considering the usage it can be put to in factories and warehouses. The drum truck can lift drums off from the ground at almost 4 inches. This aids in effectively moving the drums over other substances lying on the ground. However the overall height of the drum truck is almost 47 inches. This is as measured from the top of the handle. There are steering wheels as well as load wheels. These wheels are made from nylon. The measurements and use of the nylon material differ for the steering and load wheels. The pump handle aids greatly in manoeuvrings the drum trucks efficiently and lift, move and store the drums properly. ',	' - Low operational cost - Long working life - Hassle free functioning',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(79,	'Hydraulic Hand Stacker SPPS 2.0',	22,	'1576746782.jpg',	'hydraulic-hand-stacker-spps-2-0',	'We offer Stackers ideal for the lifting and transportation of palletized loads with various lift heights. These manual stackers incorporate all the critical features that make them number one in the industry. ',	' - Stackers are hard chromed, polished pistons that are resistant to rust, scratches and wear. - Stackers have double sealed high pressure polyurethane oil seals, to ensure long life of the hydraulic system.',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(80,	'Semi Electric Stacker SPPS 1.5S',	22,	'1576747008.png',	'semi-electric-stacker-spps-1-5s',	'Semi electric fork over stackers with 1000/1500/2000kgs capacity and WMS-E series manual fork over stackers with 1000/1500kgs capacity, years experience of manufacturing ensure the reliable quality and best feeling of operation. With handle return gas spring, brake, protection wheel cap, protection net. Compact vehicle design provides exceptional manoeuvrability in tight areas. Adjustable bended and forged fork. Lifting supporting leg keeps stacker steady when lifting or lowering. ',	' - Tonne capacity at load centres 400 / 600 mm (Manual / Semi-electric) - Manual stacker with 1.5 m lift height - Semi-electric models with lift heights of 2.4 and 3.3 m - Compact, lightweight construction',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(81,	'Drum Stacker and Tilter SPDS 0.35',	22,	'1576747176.png',	'drum-stacker-and-tilter-spds-0-35',	'We have gained a wide client base by consistently manufacturing and supplying Drum Stacker Cum Tilter. This product is ideally used in industries for handling and lifting heavy materials from one location to another. These products are manufactured at our well facilitated production unit by using high quality materials and advanced techniques. Drum Stacker ',	' - Easy to tilt - Sturdy construction - Rust proof finish',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(82,	'Flexible Conveyor',	21,	'1576496867.jpg',	'flexible-conveyor',	'With an objective to lead the way, we are committed to manufacture, export and supply a quality range of Expendable Roller Conveyor. Offered conveyor is exactly manufactured using superior grade components and latest technology under the strict guidance of our highly skilled experts as per the set industry standards. The provided conveyor is used in several industries for moving big size cartons from one place to another safely. To fulfil the precise needs of clients, we offer this Expendable Roller Conveyor in different specifications as per their needs at reasonable rates. ',	' - Requires minimum energy for the smooth and efficient operation - Can be controlled automatically and manually - Optimum operational efficiency and longer service life - It requires low maintenance',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(83,	'Belt Type Conveyor',	21,	'1576496916.jpg',	'belt-type-conveyor',	'We offer a Belt Conveyor is used for transport and buffer storage of boxed unit load with flat bottom. Belt Conveyor is a head drive PVC type belt conveyor with high speed and low noise. Belt conveyor offer by us is labour saving ',	' Economic and practical, as well as high in performance--price ratio. - Modularized design and easy assembling. - Height of support leg is adjustable, with wide application. - Surface is treated by electrostatic spray.',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(84,	'Handy Coder',	24,	'1576493547.jpg',	'handy-coder',	'With the assistance of our competent workforce, we have been committed to manufacture, supply and export tough built Handy Coder. This coder is widely used for engineering and automotive applications. Our offered coder is engineered by incorporating advanced technology and machinery so that the final output meets with the international quality levels. This coder is made available in different models and specifications that clients can avail as per their needs. We carefully deliver this Handy Coder with the help of our reliable logistics personnel within the promised time frame. ',	' - Handy and portable. - Provided with grooves which enables rubber stereo easily fit on it. - Self inking - Economy in terms of impression and cost of machine. - Easy to handle. - Maintenance Free. - Uniform printing on Corrugated Box, Poly Bags, Wooden',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(85,	'Hand Batch Coding',	24,	'1576493593.jpg',	'hand-batch-coding',	'These Manual Coding kits are like mini printing shop in your office or factory. Make your own instant rubber stamps whenever you need it. The message to be printed is very easily composed by just push fitting the grooved stereos (easily changeable) on to the groove base mat. The Inking system consists of a rechargeable felt pad, which is fully enclosed allowing the use of fast-drying ',	' - Very low cost system for small quantity printing or as standby for semi-automatic and automatic machines. - Different models with plain ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(86,	'Motorized Coding Machine EMCC',	24,	'1576493655.jpg',	'motorized-coding-machine-emcc',	'This is a reliable ',	' - Suitable for all manual ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(87,	'High Speed Batch Coding Machine IM 380 Hot Ink Roller',	24,	'1576493724.jpg',	'high-speed-batch-coding-machine-im-380-hot-ink-roller',	'We are manufacturer, exporter and supplier of Batch Coding Machine that are a compact online automatic ink coder, which are designed to print details like price, batch number, manufacturing date, expiry date etc. Moreover, the batch coders are suitably modified to include personalized details, certain types of cases and other specifications. The easily removable ink system is totally enclosed to ensure minimum ink evaporation and dust contamination. Speed of coder is synchronized by the parent machine motion. ',	' Requires minimum energy for the smooth and efficient operation. - Optimum operational efficiency and longer operational life. - Designed with high precision and are easy to handle. - Rugged design with user friendly operation. ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(88,	'High Speed Batch Coding Machine HSCC 300 For Cartons',	24,	'1576493811.jpg',	'high-speed-batch-coding-machine-hscc-300-for-cartons',	'It is mandatory for manufacturers of packaged goods to code information\'s like Batch No., Date of Mfg., Expiry Date, Prices ',	' - It is electro mechanical fully automatic high speed coding system. - Once stacks the labels / cartons in order on sloping plane tray (Dispenser) for feeding. - Its automatically Packed up by rubber friction insert, fed to printing one by one via guide',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(89,	'Ink Jet Printer 7900',	24,	'1576493885.jpg',	'ink-jet-printer-7900',	'We offering a coding solution with up to 3 lines of text, graphics and logos as standard, with up to 5 lines available if required, the Linux 7900 represents an advanced continuous ink jet printer. Linux Insight? software also helps you to take more control of your production line. With Insight? you can download or upload messages from a PC to the Linux 7900, and even monitor it from you smart phone, all you need is internet access and an Ethernet connection to your printer. And Linux Insight is included with the printer at no extra cost. ',	' - Ethernet port - 3 line printing - Data Matrix 2D codes - RS232 connectivity - External single stage alarm output - Connectivity for product detectors and shaft encoders',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(90,	'ERCC Printer',	24,	'1576834964.jpg',	'ercc-printer',	'3535 ERCC PLC based fully automatic, ELECTRONIC ROTARY CONTACT CODER is suitable for registered printing ',	' - The EMCC is truly operator friendly coder. It comes with PLC which provides guidance for Quick operation. - This is portable compact ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(91,	'Printing Coveyor Con 3015',	24,	'1576493972.jpg',	'printing-coveyor-con-3015',	'Printing conveyor is used for transporting sheets, envelopes, tickets, labels, open boxes, cartons, and more allied products. This machine shows a perfect mix of mechanical parts, compact ',	' - Simple adjustment - Easy To Move - Compact Design - Excellent Speed - Minimum Noise - Stainless Steel Components',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(92,	'Hand Batch Coding(Printing)',	24,	'1576494029.png',	'hand-batch-coding-printing',	'We are offering the high quality Manual Hand Batch Coding (Printing) Machine. Which is manufactured using quality approved component and contemporary technology. Manual Hand Batch Coding (Printing) Machine can print on thin cardboard, paper sheet, leather, plastic film, aluminium foil etc. we also providing this customized machine it according to the needs of our customer. ',	' â€¢ Hassle free performance\r\nâ€¢ Easy to operate\r\nâ€¢ Maintenance free\r\nâ€¢ Adopt ribbon printing, characterized by high definition, instant dry, non stickiness.\r\nâ€¢ Adopt constant temperature with adjustable temperature, suitable for ribbon made from different kinds of materials.\r\nâ€¢ Operated manually, which is very easy.',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(93,	'Pad Printing',	24,	'1576494080.jpg',	'pad-printing',	'We Offer Pad Printing Machine. Logos ,Manufacturing Date ,bar code ,ingredient issues on industrial product of food ,beverage,electric  apparatus ,cans, pharmacy etc. it can print on any flat,curved  or uneven Surface on metal,plastic, glass ,nylon ,ceramic etc. at speed upto 2000 strokes per hour .this  pad printing machine suitable for printing LOGOs and fixed information on small jars, glass , foil , tins, bottles . Multiple machine can be used for multiple color ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(94,	'Batch Printing Ink For Pouch and Plastic jar',	25,	'1576494930.jpg',	'batch-printing-ink-for-pouch-and-plastic-jar',	'Specially formulated inks for marking ',	' - Permanent Marker Ink - Pad Printing Ink - Capsule Printing Ink',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(95,	'Batch Printing Ink For Porous',	25,	'1576494975.jpg',	'batch-printing-ink-for-porous',	'Specially formulated fast drying inks for marking on absorbable surface like carton, wood box, shippers, asbestos, plywood, drums, etc, it gives a very clear impression without smudging. Available colour: Black, Violet, Blue, Green ',	' - Permanent Marker Ink - Pad Printing Ink - Capsule Printing Ink',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(96,	'Ink Aid',	25,	'1576495018.jpg',	'ink-aid',	'Specially formulated solvent for diluting fast ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(97,	'Rubber Stereo Flat/Grove/Polymer',	26,	'1576495159.jpg',	'rubber-stereo-flat-grove-polymer',	'The clients can avail Rubber Stereos from us. These products are procured from trusted vendors and possess long life with reliability. We have Rubber Stereo in Groove, flat and Polymer with Alpha/Numeric Set by using easily changeable grooved/flat rubber/nylon stereos. We are the leading manufacturing of Rubber stereo in 1.5 mm ,2 mm ,3 mm , 4 mm , 6 mm , 8 mm , 10 mm , 14 mm , 25 mm , 39 mm and also mfg of all types of Strips in Hindi and English with and without groove in all above sizes ',	' Rubber stereo in 1.5 mm ,2 mm ,3 mm , 4 mm , 6 mm , 8 mm , 10 mm , 14 mm , 25 mm , 39 mm and also mfg of all types of Strips in Hindi and English with and without groove in all above sizes ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(98,	'Rubber Stereo Flat/Grove/Polymer 8mm',	26,	'1576495216.jpg',	'rubber-stereo-flat-grove-polymer-8mm',	'The clients can avail Rubber Stereos from us. These products are procured from trusted vendors and possess long life with reliability. We have Rubber Stereo in Groove, flat and Polymer with Alpha/Numeric Set by using easily changeable grooved/flat rubber/nylon stereos. We are the leading manufacturing of Rubber stereo in 1.5 mm ,2 mm ,3 mm , 4 mm , 6 mm , 8 mm , 10 mm , 14 mm , 25 mm , 39 mm and also mfg of all types of Strips in Hindi and English with and without groove in all above sizes ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(99,	'Rubber Stereo Flat/Grove/Polymer-14mm ',	26,	'1576495452.jpg',	'rubber-stereo-flat-grove-polymer-14mm',	'The clients can avail Rubber Stereos from us. These products are procured from trusted vendors and possess long life with reliability. We have Rubber Stereo in Groove, flat and Polymer with Alpha/Numeric Set by using easily changeable grooved/flat rubber/nylon stereos. We are the leading manufacturing of Rubber stereo in 1.5 mm ,2 mm ,3 mm , 4 mm , 6 mm , 8 mm , 10 mm , 14 mm , 25 mm , 39 mm and also mfg of all types of Strips in Hindi and English with and without groove in all above sizes ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(100,	'Thermal Transfer Ribbon 25mm,35mm ',	26,	'1576495270.jpg',	'thermal-transfer-ribbon-25mm-35mm',	'Thermal Transfer ribbons are designed specifically to meet the challenges of flexible packaging applications. Featuring back coat technology, ribbons are optimized for use with printers, and when used together, the combination helps ensure fewer ribbon breaks, better print quality, optimized adhesion and the uptime performance your operation demands. ',	' - provides for optimal thermal conduction for ink transfer and optimal code quality - protects the print head - extends print head life - helps to dissipate static charge (which can damage the print head and degrade code quality)',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(101,	'Ink Roller',	26,	'1576495318.jpg',	'ink-roller',	'Our trade in a range of Ink Rollers using special imported bonded cellulose fibres. These fibres are solid, durable and porous structures with a high ink absorbing capacity, which reduces the frequency of re-inking. We offer these rollers in different sizes as per the requirement and demand of the clients. ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(102,	'Hot Ink Roller',	26,	'1576495364.jpg',	'hot-ink-roller',	'Our Hot Ink Rollers have been specifically developed to produce high quality prints when used on all popular Hot Ink printing machines. We supply a wide range of grades, colours and sizes to suit the vast majority of applications. Use our easy selection filter to identify the hot roll product best suited to your needs. You can narrow your search selecting any combination of Printer, Outside roll diameter, roll width (or length), colour and grade. ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(103,	'LD Shrink Films',	28,	'1576497930.jpg',	'ld-shrink-films',	'We offer a wide range of LD shrink films, which is available in different cuts, lengths and types. These LD shrink films are extensively used for vegetables, fruits, food items, beverages and other FMCG products. Apart from ensuring safe packaging, our range also enhances the look of the products. ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
(104,	'PVC Pouches /Pouches for Bottle',	28,	'1576498019.jpg',	'pvc-pouches-pouches-for-bottle',	'We are offering our clients a comprehensive range of Shrink Bags that is widely used in different purposes for packaging. The offered bags are manufactured by our team of experts using premium grade raw material in compliance with the set international market standards. Available in different patterns, finishes and colours, we can also custom design these Shrink Bags as per the requirements of our customers. We also export and supply a high quality range of Shrinkable Bottle Seals that is widely used in packaging industry. We offered bottle seals are quality tested on various parameters prior to dispatch. Available in diverse lengths, thicknesses and colours, our firm offers these Shrinkable Bottle Seals to the clients at reasonable prices. ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
