(106,	'PVC Pouches /Pouches for Bottle 110*180',	28,	'1576498112.jpg',	'pvc-pouches-pouches-for-bottle-110-180',	'We are offering our clients a comprehensive range of Shrink Bags that is widely used in different purposes for packaging. The offered bags are manufactured by our team of experts using premium grade raw material in compliance with the set international market standards. Available in different patterns, finishes and colours, we can also custom design these Shrink Bags as per the requirements of our customers. We also export and supply a high quality range of Shrinkable Bottle Seals that is widely used in packaging industry. We offered bottle seals are quality tested on various parameters prior to dispatch. Available in diverse lengths, thicknesses and colours, our firm offers these Shrinkable Bottle Seals to the clients at reasonable prices. ',	' ',	'2019-07-13 10:10:10'),
