(333,	'Vacuum Pouch',	31,	'1576587578.jpg',	'vacuum-pouch',	'Vacuum pouch offers extensive range of high barrier 9, 7, 5 layer co-extruded barrier vacuum packing, gas flush and MAP Pouches These pouches are available in various sizes, have great strength and high clarity, and provide additional protection against oxygen\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 12:59:38'),
(334,	'Silver Pouch',	31,	'1576587635.jpg',	'silver-pouch',	'We bring for our clients a very effective packaging bag ?the Silver Pouch. We offer the range in a variety of sizes, thickness and designs. Ideally suited for packing the contents which are not consumed at one go, the contents can be neatly sealed again in these pouches after each usage. Clients can avail these Silver Pouches at industry leading prices and can also customize them as per client\'s requiremen\"s. Strong packaging standards maintained that reduce security risks of shipment.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:00:35'),
(335,	'Foam Fruit Net',	31,	'1576587700.jpg',	'foam-fruit-net',	'Foam Fruit Packaging Net is provided by us to customers in various sizes and specifications. These products are provided by us at industry leading prices to clients. For the complete satisfaction of the customers, we are involved in offering good quality of Foam Fruit Packaging Net. This Foam Fruit Packaging Net is extensively used in various suitable applications like for packing of Grapes, Orange, Banana and apples etc.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:01:40'),
(336,	'Fruit Net',	31,	'1576587762.jpg',	'fruit-net',	'Foam Fruit Packaging Net is provided by us to customers in various sizes and specifications. These products are provided by us at industry leading prices to clients. For the complete satisfaction of the customers, we are involved in offering good quality of Foam Fruit Packaging Net. This Foam Fruit Packaging Net is extensively used in various suitable applications like for packing of Grapes, Orange, Banana and apples etc.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:02:42'),
(337,	'PP Sutli',	33,	'1576588069.jpg',	'pp-suit',	'We are offering PP Sutli in virgin and semi virgin quality. Our range of PP Sutli is manufactured from qualitative range of raw materials. These PP Sutli are offered in variety of designs, shapes, sizes and colours. Our assortment of PP Sutli is available at market leading prices.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:07:49'),
(338,	'Bopp Tape',	33,	'1576588163.jpg',	'bopp-tape',	'Being specialized in domain, we are offering a wide assortment of BOPP Tape. The offered BOPP Tape is used in stationery, for packaging carton box in various industries and many more purposes. Moreover, one can avail this BOPP Tape from us in various sizes and colours.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:09:23'),
(339,	'Stretch Film',	33,	'1576588258.jpg',	'stretch-film',	'Keeping into consideration the increasing demands of the patrons, our firm is providing a large array of Stretch Film. For wrapping items on pallet, one can use this Stretch Film. This Stretch Film provides best packaging to the items thus protecting them from damage\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:10:58'),
(340,	'Tape Dispenser',	33,	'1576588355.jpg',	'tape-dispenser',	'We are amongst the noted suppliers and exporters of Tape Dispensers. Designed and developed at par with international quality standards, our products are widely used in tape maker. Tape Dispensers exhibit high end properties such as elegant look, light weight and longer service life.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:12:35'),
(341,	'Tape Dispenser 3 inch',	33,	'1576588410.jpg',	'tape-dispenser-3-inch',	'Aluminium foil is used to seal the opening on HDPE jar as well as acting as a very effective tamper-proof lid. The aluminium foil die cut lids prevents the product from deterioration\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:13:30'),
(342,	'Air Bobble Roll/Pouches',	33,	'1576588490.jpg',	'air-bobble-roll-pouches',	'Air bubble bags and pouches which are superior packaging material options for excellent cushioning and adequate surface protection for such items. You can employ these high quality envelopes, which are most popularly used to send CDs, DVDs and other small sized fragile items falling under the handle with care category. These envelopes feature seamless edges and bottom attribute to extra cushioning for added protection and safety for the item packed. These are available at low costs and further, being light in weight. The safety is further enhanced by its 3-sided sealing. What makes these envelopes different is their inner lining of air bubbles that serves to absorb all the shocks to protect the items from any damage during the transit.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:14:48'),
(343,	'Corrugates Roll',	33,	'1576588582.jpg',	'corrugates-roll',	'If you deal with fragile items, corrugated rolls are a must for ensuring their safety while packaging. They can be used to wrap delicate goods such as glass-wares, paintings, metal parts, china materials and basic office or household products that risk their safety often. While you stack many fragile goods together in a packaging box, a corrugated roll can be used to pack each item separately to enhance their safety. It helps them give a layer of cushion and the chances of them colliding and breaking each other will drastically reduce. They also easily wrap with goods of all shapes and sizes due to their high crush resistance.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:16:22'),
(344,	'EP Foam Sheet',	33,	'1576588646.jpg',	'ep-foam-sheet',	'Our foam pouches and bags are durable yet very adaptable packing materials, available in different foam thicknesses and dimensions. The foam pouches occupy only a little space, allowing for cost-effective storage and transfer. Made up of high quality polyethylene, these are efficient at protecting your items from damage caused by shifting and vibrations. These are great at protecting the small items and very easy to use. The lightweight and moisture resistant foam keeps your product secured and clean. You can choose from our wide variety of foam sizes and thicknesses to fulfil your specific needs or get in touch with us, should you have a bespoke inquiry.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:17:26'),
(345,	'Thread bag closer',	33,	'1576588715.jpg',	'thread-bag-closer',	'We are supplying an extensive range of PP Thread to fulfil the requirements of our clients. These are fabricated with premium quality polypropylene by our reliable vendors. These threads are strong enough and ensure long lasting life.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:18:35'),
(346,	'Shrink Label',	33,	'1576588766.jpg',	'shrink-lable',	'Reverse Printed Shrinkable Sleeves are being used all over the world by food, beverages, pharmaceutical and cosmetic manufactures on their containers to improve aesthetic value as well as to boost the brand image of their products. Reverse Printed sleeve offers possibility of distortion-free coverage of the container for 360 and hence, they are ideal to use for glass, plastic, PET, composite cans and tin containers.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:19:26'),
(347,	'Edge Protector',	33,	'1576588849.jpg',	'edge-protector',	'We are one of the well reputed suppliers of Edge Board. Our offered edge board is a packaging solution for the coverage of sides of a container. The offered edge board ensures that the internal belongings are not affected by any mechanical stress on the sides of the package box. Our offered edge board is an efficient fibre material which can effectively seal any pre-closed package box.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:20:49'),
(348,	'Edge Protector 55 mm',	33,	'1576588928.jpg',	'edge-protector-55-mm',	'ISPM 15 refers to Publication 15 of International Standards for Phytosanitary Measures, which regulates Wood Packaging Material in International Trade. ISPM is a global standard developed to reduce the risk arising out of pests across Country borders through wood packaging material such as the conventional hardwood pallets. Several countries have implemented or in the process of implementing ISPM 15 Compliance for their imports. In such instances, the wood packaging material must be either ISPM 15 compliant; or of a form where ISPM 15 standard do not apply. In order the wood packaging material is ISPM15 compliant, the wood pallets must either be fumigated with methyl bromide or subject to heat treatment of a minimum of 56 degree Celsius for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:22:08'),
(349,	'Tape Roll for Bread Sealer',	33,	'1576588987.jpg',	'tape-roll-for-bread-sealer',	'We are strongly supported by a well established and fully equipped R\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:23:07'),
(350,	'Wooden Pallet',	33,	'1576589204.jpg',	'wooden-pallet',	'ISPM 15 refers to Publication 15 of International Standards for Phytosanitary Measures, which regulates Wood Packaging Material in International Trade. ISPM is a global standard developed to reduce the risk arising out of pests across Country borders through wood packaging material such as the conventional hardwood pallets. Several countries have implemented or in the process of implementing ISPM 15 Compliance for their imports. In such instances, the wood packaging material must be either ISPM 15 compliant; or of a form where ISPM 15 standard do not apply. In order the wood packaging material is ISPM15 compliant, the wood pallets must either be fumigated with methyl bromide or subject to heat treatment of a minimum of 56 degree Celsius for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-17 13:26:44'),
(351,	'PVC Strip Door',	34,	'1576648089.jpg',	'pvc-strip-door',	'PVC Strip Doors have almost limitless applications. These are equally beneficial in very large openings or single doorways. PVC Strip Doors provide an excellent solution to a variety of environmental challenges in the work place. They provide an excellent thermal barrier, keeping the cool and warm air exchange to a minimum therefore dramatically reducing energy costs and providing a more comfortable working environment.\r\n\r\n',	'- Reduces Heat or Cold Air Loss by opening only wide enough to let a person or vehicle through and then closing automatically. - Isolates Noisy Machinery and equipment, work station and loading docks from other work areas. - Restricts Movement of Air Poll\r\n\r\n',	'2019-12-18 05:48:09'),
(352,	'Weld Screen PVC Welding Curtain',	34,	'1576648259.jpg',	'weld-screen-pvc-welding-curtain',	'Superior protection for your welding operations. Welding Curtains shield fellow employees from the flying sparks and hazardous glare of your welding operations and protect against serious eye damage by screening out harmful UV rays. Dark Green Welding Curtains allow easy access to personnel, trolleys, and equipment from any point throughout the enclosure. It allows supervisors to monitor the activity and the safety of the worker inside the enclosure.\r\n\r\n',	'- Welding curtains shield fellow employees from the flying sparks and hazardous glare of your welding operations - Protect against serious eye damage by screening out harmful UV and near UV rays. - Welding curtains allow easy access to personal, trolley\r\n\r\n',	'2019-12-18 05:50:59'),
(353,	'Freezer PVC Strip Freezer Curtain',	34,	'1576648395.jpg',	'freezer-pvc-strip-freezer-curtain',	'Windows is Commercial food preparation areas need to comply with the latest food and Hygiene regulations by fitting a screen which prevents the entry of insects, birds and other infestation. Insect proof PVC strip curtain is an ideal solution for anywhere that insects aren?t welcome. Insect proof PVC strip curtain made with a specially formulated repellent material that wards off insects. Sanitation authorities are highly concern with the hygiene condition of food and drug handling areas.\r\n\r\n',	'- Back doors of restaurant. - Personal doors at commercial and manufacturing location. - Open air concession at parks, sports areas and other outdoor facilities. - Any open area where flying insects are a pest.\r\n\r\n',	'2019-12-18 05:53:15'),
(354,	'PVC Strip Blue',	34,	'1576648494.jpg',	'pvc-strip-blue',	'PVC Strip Doors have almost limitless applications. These are equally beneficial in very large openings or single doorways. PVC Strip Doors provide an excellent solution to a variety of environmental challenges in the work place. They provide an excellent thermal barrier, keeping the cool and warm air exchange to a minimum therefore dramatically reducing energy costs and providing a more comfortable working environmen\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-18 05:54:54'),
(355,	'PVC Strip red and yellow welding',	34,	'1576648618.jpg',	'pvc-strip-red-and-yellow-welding',	'Superior protection for your welding operations. Welding Curtains shield fellow employees from the flying sparks and hazardous glare of your welding operations and protect against serious eye damage by screening out harmful UV rays. Dark Green Welding Curtains allow easy access to personnel, trolleys, and equipment from any point throughout the enclosure. It allows supervisors to monitor the activity and the safety of the worker inside the enclosure\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-18 05:56:58'),
(356,	'PVC strip Curtains multicolor',	34,	'1576648697.jpg',	'pvc-strip-curtains-multicolor',	'PVC Strip Doors have almost limitless applications. These are equally beneficial in very large openings or single doorways. PVC Strip Doors provide an excellent solution to a variety of environmental challenges in the work place. They provide an excellent thermal barrier, keeping the cool and warm air exchange to a minimum therefore dramatically reducing energy costs and providing a more comfortable working environment.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-18 05:58:17'),
(357,	'Induction Wads for HDPE Jar',	30,	'1576649350.jpg',	'induction-weds-for-hdpe-jar',	'Induction Seal for HDPE Bottles are used for a simple and reliable method of bottle sealing. It welds an aluminium foil seal across the bottleneck to prevent product leakage. These induction seals are manufactured using high-grade material. These induction seals and wads for HDPE bottles are designed in compliance with industrial standard to ensure the high quality. These seals improve product shelf life due to the excellent barrier properties of the foil.\r\n\r\n',	'N/A',	'2019-12-18 06:09:10'),
(358,	'Induction Wads for PET Jar',	30,	'1576649437.jpg',	'induction-weds-for-pet-jar',	'Induction Seals for Pet Bottles are available in the market. These seals are fixed around the bottleneck by welding or other heating methods. Manufactured using quality raw material, these products can be customized on the bases of layers and colours. Available in different designs, these seals help in keeping the products safe and are widely used in packaging materials. One can avail these products in various customized specifications at leading prices in the market.\r\n\r\n',	'Induction Seals for Pet Bottles are available in the market. These seals are fixed around the bottleneck by welding or other heating methods. Manufactured using quality raw material, these products can be customized on the bases of layers and colours. Available in different designs, these seals help in keeping the products safe and are widely used in packaging materials. One can avail these products in various customized specifications at leading prices in the market.\r\n\r\n',	'2019-12-18 06:10:37'),
